// (wide, round glyphs) and "last layer." (narrow ones) — measured against ink,
// a flat 0.54 was 6% too NARROW on one and 30% too WIDE on the other. That error
// showed up as the black caption plate hugging some lines and ballooning past
// others.
//
// USED ONLY for the plate rectangle. Wrapping and block geometry deliberately
// still use the flat average, so line breaks in existing slideshows are
// unchanged.

